  "body": "### What is the issue with the URL Pattern Standard?\r\n\r\n\r\nI have completed the translation of the URL Pattern specification into Simplified Chinese (简体中文). Here is the link to the translated document:\r\n\r\n- [Translated version of the specification in Simplified Chinese](https://htmlspecs.com/urlpattern )\r\n\r\nIt would be helpful for international users if this link could be added to the official documentation.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering this request!\r\n",
